The [original incident page](/kb/incidents/4471) calls this one known issue with one queued fix. Its code separates parser and booking-form hint paths, but it also assigns contradictory symptoms to parser without reading their bodies. Keep actionable tickets for the modeled causes and separate investigations for the unmatched problems. A footnote does not give a problem an owner or a resolution path.

